WEBVTT

00:11:57.780 --> 00:12:01.050
when you find yourself wanting to say
"we're like family" around work

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:02.218
or organizations,

00:12:02.218 --> 00:12:04.187
try to get clearer in your communication

00:12:04.187 --> 00:12:07.423
and use language
that has better boundaries.

00:12:07.457 --> 00:12:09.225
As Brené Brown says,

00:12:09.259 --> 00:12:11.828
"Clear is kind. Unclear is unkind."

00:12:12.328 --> 00:12:15.131
So if you find yourself wanting
to say "We're like family,"

00:12:15.131 --> 00:12:17.267
but you're really kind of
asking for a favor,

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:19.402
clarify that, say, "Hey, you know,

00:12:19.435 --> 00:12:22.005
we actually need this
deliverable a week sooner.

00:12:22.038 --> 00:12:24.240
What can we do to achieve that?"

00:12:24.274 --> 00:12:29.145
Or if you're just trying to communicate
a value about your organization,

00:12:29.178 --> 00:12:32.048
again, clarify the language
and use boundaries.